# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Anything committed here is visible to the world,
# permanently, including in history after a later deletion.
#
# It sits one directory below the private bar book. `bar-book.html` names a
# real person seventeen times, carries her ratings and palate profile, and
# lists what every bottle cost. `people.json` is notes on guests. None of that
# may ever appear here, and the cheapest way to guarantee it is to ignore
# everything and name the exceptions.
#
# The parent directory is outside this repo, so git cannot reach it. This file
# is the second lock, for the day someone copies a file down here to "just
# check something".

# Deny by default.
*

# Allow, explicitly.
!.gitignore
!index.html
!CNAME
!README.md
